{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30008_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ee93fc36a4c8b9dc3143ab0d1fab473a69d1da9fc3720eb40c33502123f41440",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:063cee1a74979218684b68d2c51cd870facf11fe28debba8ebe3277477517b4c",
      "text": "各自的长处",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48b6b425fd21311f2bb97060b0f8d0a7a5b5b68934b0eb7182ffa9fe6c91a72a",
      "text": "翔太、春名、类、卷绪、九郎5人，将作为视频\n企划进行录音花絮的拍摄。\n凭借各自的共同点与极高的契合度，5人之间的关系\n逐渐加深。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_a:cmd-000026:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_a:cmd-000026:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:063cee1a74979218684b68d2c51cd870facf11fe28debba8ebe3277477517b4c",
      "text": "各自的长处",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:812b962c9ad14c8f86bfbf32803b46c75ba7c33ccb3178a4e5b0be4772e1ea2f",
      "text": "大家好呀！说到跳舞那就交给我吧！\n我是Jupiter的御手洗翔太哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9517cb1a88d8636478a780aace6078ed583d0c11050929f5790e218443972b0c",
      "text": "接下来要向看视频的大家介绍这次的成员啦♪\n那么下一位，春名先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76f238e3ab8bb149a00f80596c784ef22a8ceeed8f3801b786875ae6133537d3",
      "text": "噢！我是High×Joker的鼓手担当，若里春名！\n提到甜甜圈的事就包在我身上吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19d2c58b913fb3cf5174081d7abd4b981a48a265ff9e0592f230d7d4bc970c97",
      "text": "Hello，我是S.E.M的舞田类哦！\n有关English的事，尽管交给俺☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_a:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcdefd2fb689bb4edce9015e6523dc4b6be4e257a1f038f9b2178cd5a85523c2",
      "text": "大家好，我是Cafe Parade的卯月卷绪。\n要是蛋糕相关的事，就请交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_a:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c897c41f84645bc1353943294de9277f6175b6cc308602724341b04d349af59d",
      "text": "（大家都在聊自己的特长呢。\n我是不是，也应该顺着说下去才好……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_a:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f960c2d8b381c3b604a94f0a58f65c4e78ea6490709c744bd1a9657e90362c8",
      "text": "在下名为清澄九郎。所属组合是彩。\n……要、要是关于茶道的事，就请尽管交给我吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_a:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d74390e82dcf11b37a6035031560a2ef0b13fc0c66afb99dbbf9fc4a65342ed",
      "text": "噢噢～打招呼的方式出奇地统一啊！明明事先\n都没对过，我们未免也太有默契了吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_a:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d52ca068a30bb0b53ee93409224f6af6ec4614c3660df2938d043dfb7e2c62de",
      "text": "Yes！按这势头下去，\n不论什么企划都能happy地搞定呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_a:cmd-000192:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:854d8e5346faf84c9ab1092fb3ef98ca1cc9cda248e5ea06ca5c7210edf032de",
      "text": "耶——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_a:cmd-000215:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5d1c596868a220d161f86f1936fde2cbf010a1e9a1ccaa51f5404be2b18d8ae",
      "text": "（这就是所谓的击掌吧。\n虽然反应稍微慢了一拍，但好在赶上了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7130ddc4aa5a6c5695c44508370cfaccebb3833851dbde4b92f6a074ef20ac8",
      "text": "这次要在这群成员中决定接下来要做的企划哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_b:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbe4d8182d43acbdc566962b044a13c3f3a430bf1465816e4f0c1810ebf589be",
      "text": "各位，明明answer期间那么short，\n却还是留了这么多留言，thanks☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5712013a9fb2e65a1895eef989ce75b7d797915ce49cbba6c35de84aa76a4ba",
      "text": "我之前一直特别期待看大家的问卷反馈呢。\n回复的量完全超出预料，真是吓了我一跳。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_b:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e781b235808ac35eaf7ffc899ce059c162d63ded38a685ef9059974a18232af3",
      "text": "既然有这么多，真不知道该选哪一个好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_b:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1d144ce346314e016d22ab48e4ca7add7c986cebcd7a9dbcc38408b5fad0553",
      "text": "话说回来，听说从企划公布的那一刻起，\n就有很多人给出反响了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_b:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff3fe5e159fdd61fe4f09dcf93df2623510c22bfb3b7ee7cc4ba93ce40a67f90",
      "text": "谢谢大家的感想！\n我们全都会仔细看的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_b:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47c6225213b7764ac36aac9894bde154c4ea05a6f197c38af9b7ab60231b09a4",
      "text": "哎呀，毕竟企划公布的同时，\n还一口气公开了3首新歌嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_b:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab68ba342273376ad76c0bcb178e16355685e3a33e7a9f5c09833af949a42da5",
      "text": "那个消息公布之后啊，我的粉丝信里好多人都在说\n“好期待若里君会和谁分到一组啊！”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_b:cmd-000165:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d02db5b7e7f991e897a36c117ad85ed1fad4bfa327e6775e3229173236f36cb",
      "text": "Oh！Me too哦，Mr. 若里！\n我也收到了好多好多！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_b:cmd-000192:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d83d5a5d48e3dcc2196396aa404e0fd46a03eb22f9d9af819daf88f1bb36cba5",
      "text": "（完全插不上话……我也必须更加主动地\n参与发言才行……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_b:cmd-000197:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1685a1db898da2cfb289158b9284555c854290cc08dfb7ca5d4a617f51c0b693",
      "text": "（一定有只有我才能做到的事）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73611d31227662baecf1e9316a561a4e13b4718d42f4bf140443fedf22805e14",
      "text": "各位，闲聊不妨先告一段落，\n我们一起看看问卷的内容如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:368f295d6cf522ca53bb317784e7ad1676c8ce9984ff5991b1417223fd1ffbd2",
      "text": "让我们确认一下粉丝们\n到底希望我们做些什么吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a859f930cb2138714b5399beb8f6942b68a562bcb3e22ce9672dd12771adaf7a",
      "text": "说的也是呢！呃——让我看看……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_c:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8e0624e368600bf9ac08240cd66fc4c09ede812f71844ee4cea6ca6fc8bbc3d",
      "text": "每一个都很有意思呢～！\n……啊，比如这个感觉马上就能实现。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_c:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6c26d1300fd3c27b9ba855ace312ea8a1c954e6d1d3e4bbf61b09c4f8792520",
      "text": "哦～这个吗。“想知道\n大家平时经常去的店！”啊。那我的话肯定就是甜甜圈店啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_c:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fd49e1cc02d8fd1e1e5951ecba8e112ec73ded15f356acdd80d37e750ae1e73",
      "text": "呃，这样一下不就聊完了嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_c:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbd07fc1e9813c57ae0a6ff8dfebcc03b0b28d970820c93bfa0fcd3cc9fb5cd9",
      "text": "这个……好像是海外的问卷调查结果。上面写着舞田\n老师的名字，能麻烦您读一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_c:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a441247b89a80b75f2b38972cd6dbb285ffe6efe20bf80fd87685770317f63a4",
      "text": "OK！“你好，315 Production的各位！\n我希望舞田老师能上一堂english课”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_c:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b8c8319c9198f091827130eb9ef521bf452e50eff77284c3cca4dd1ccdf2bb3",
      "text": "这边也是英文呢～。春名先生，念一下嘛～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_c:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d6ce3c42fbdd02f906dc7941fd59a229697029211753462c9b194d7ae2ec272",
      "text": "啊——……那个，我只擅长说英语啦～\n九郎先生怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_c:cmd-000176:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:658488c6e8ba17cbf5f7180f7aff6f6c215fb9624640a1adbbb0efae3cf1778e",
      "text": "实在惭愧，在下仅懂得一些简单的问候。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_c:cmd-000186:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:731040e2a09df8769b5ec0ff95c038918e00ff3b1abdf9b80432207ff8929913",
      "text": "只要会打招呼，就能和任何人talk了哦！\n所以，要有自信一点☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_d:cmd-000029:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08e75e31fce1b642e0ab2126ddd687bf20c77d198982346963039aafe0d92df0",
      "text": "十多分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ed0e682cf1d947020a0c165ef6ea5f554f07c34ab8060d65908ce4eb7879816",
      "text": "我也总算明白其他视频里\n大家为什么会那么纠结了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8203f3678f78a42f284635f40984b443e1762b97cc2257f80923dcfdb5a956ea",
      "text": "是啊，比想象中还要难以抉择呢……\n确实无论哪一个，都会让人想要尝试看看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_d:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75c6d1dee2bf747e6f1111d90bda96d1c561fd54547560746b52f61705057b0f",
      "text": "呐，呐。那这个怎么样？\n有好几个人提了这项要求哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_d:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8df63bafa5b9010146d3a8284b7726b0ffc29d50daa7b18f287031d1578bfc72",
      "text": "“想看录音花絮”\n“想看大家Sing的样子！”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:606219c9dd67756d732f4e73f9300a5f72ec584bb64bbc248350dfa1288a2b07",
      "text": "我这边也有类似的反馈哦！\n说是“想看在演唱会之外唱歌的样子”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_d:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c66d8fcb7c1c89f07ae3db6c623d89012fe60ce25503a72a307574d5d46e559",
      "text": "这边也有！既然有这么多人提，\n说明想看这个的人确实非常多吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_d:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9d99271ed5daf93220eb561cb2eb9f3eaa430e33950bccfc5aaff02e555f46a",
      "text": "隼人他们之前展示过跳舞的样子，\n不过这个好像其他成员都还没做过吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_d:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fe64de489b1477d7b6a0de40888712f7e2afd75f636865536e77731b4859d7e",
      "text": "是的！录音花絮确实还从来没有过呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_d:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc3098f3c6e40d244dc2cd650471297eafd289d05d90876474805b8db877fd5f",
      "text": "要不要像其他视频那样，把上课练习的画面也拍下来？\n想看平时上课练习的人也超级多的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_d:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:306b4cd0bf0522879ecbc7e38e0fdc843681ad951dc634ebf5eb87f94931a01a",
      "text": "Nice idea呢，Mr. 御手洗！\n那就按这个方向来推进吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d5883d6f0fe59f5cb00291300f64df21516d18bdc2bebd66c86e37c22850adf",
      "text": "好，OK！\n先暂停一下拍摄哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af6126471cf936eb0a5043f7ac4617c129b2a6d51012568cfb046b71b80fb4c8",
      "text": "制作人，\n录音现场的花絮拍摄能够安排吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ac72c0999e51fb86b07515a74d0544bc3732bb0e08d5e548014317641ade779",
      "text": "请放心。当然没问题！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_e:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d86e5b5e3a493f0f7068892e5b40fe0e64424d94dc939b871866349da2eb5bcd",
      "text": "从定下这次拍摄起，为了能应对任何突发状况，\n我们早就提前协调好日程了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_e:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae0b9e858aa30dd75f26d6a27815126a7af318742d08d35c39d88723964b9ffd",
      "text": "Amazing！真不愧是制作人酱呢♪\n那接下来，我们就来敲定细节部分吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_e:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb9abc386ef675330c27ba63af38fb82ba64bb19373fd827cb21fc69840afb48",
      "text": "既然如此，后面的内容也边拍边定会比较好吧？\n我们马上开始吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_e:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1d38e6fb4acf38d481d8eb48f8761043367d90899806ccb97d986bfe5de6b52",
      "text": "欸——聊了好多已经好累了啦～\n稍微休息一下再继续嘛？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_e:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8daa4edc1ddee9a87b502f5fd9f7335cfa2b618576b5ae15bc74e2d5e6635aaf",
      "text": "说的也是呢。那我们先休息一下吧。\n拍摄等休息完之后再重新开始。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_e:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:217aefe645e7c31e86a7406ea7e24745fc4bce451938466b75b95b5a8ad06858",
      "text": "收到！各位，我带了甜甜圈当慰劳品，\n一起来吃吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_e:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ccf4c42b9958e7014a6bc7b00ed25b61edb9a27dd8893f14d7fc0fa6464aa2c",
      "text": "春名君也带了？其实我也带了蛋糕来\n给大家当慰劳品呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_e:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73a7c160cea12dc19c96fa8dfd38aca9f048e3e88faa017e8e8d3d46fda60ce4",
      "text": "果然动完脑子之后的休息时间，\n吃蛋糕才是最棒的呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:473e639a573c861243a8ca61234d048c0361b83e8f73bf7e7897894c78439fcf",
      "text": "确实，蛋糕也很适合用来补充糖分啦。\n但我觉得果然还是甜甜圈更胜一筹啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e835b6e94dc2b3db3ff01fc39465e0a891e3b18da6ba7ce37a3b0a952175711f",
      "text": "不管在什么时候，只要吃一口甜甜圈，\n就会打起精神对吧？所以第一名非甜甜圈莫属！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fb444a80a786333748fdee2a551b67606eb1b76077763ae8c331b5329f5d7d0",
      "text": "既然这么说，那我认为是蛋糕。蛋糕无论是\n特别的纪念日还是平凡的日常，总能给人带来快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f2b81c57031c1567fc435e413bdcf73cb81e70b86a9ed035f4ea66123ed92d9",
      "text": "别别别，甜甜圈也是一样的好吧！\n所以说，这种时候就该吃甜甜圈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60c4799e3ffc650ead40bd497a8048dfebc5cb68230670437abf7faa3c675de3",
      "text": "不，是蛋糕！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8492f15f65eefd9a514dc18f1b9ec87b0e93ed7630f04b1b00a45d45500ceca5",
      "text": "哎呀～怎么感觉有点要吵起来了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0011799f3957619c360b8071a465ec340e3d96a3e47b39b85ede14745ac48c48",
      "text": "这样下去可不行呢。\n在下是否应该上前劝阻……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e75626bc6f721860edf64fb890fea29b000932a83e5c806b9ee1465b00d66f4",
      "text": "No problem啦，Mr. 清澄！\n他们两个只是在discussion而已啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:458ef6365e7e0396f579f2813b4f42a5686cd929f1f5593a6bb79a51433e83af",
      "text": "有时候像那样好好聊聊也很重要哦。\n而且把话说开了，感情反而会更好呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5c336021eb2ae167c1874ee85091dafb4f97818f539d81e9f768e29277c6ae5",
      "text": "是、是这样吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:728f97d591eb815851613ee952628b3f9e6a2975b5a6d56352a84c53bd056a22",
      "text": "甜甜圈的种类那么丰富对吧？\n而且拿起来就能轻松吃掉，这点很棒啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f1fa4c2b42765cb7570538bd776853573957b546514182575458bdb1bce98a1",
      "text": "那蛋糕也是一样的啊。\n不论专卖店还是便利店，哪里都能买到！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:165951659b426b63aa071b3251f68e10bd5cfbdd5917e0684f9ba69a9076e92b",
      "text": "……呼。看样子光靠我们两个讨论，\n是很难讨论出答案了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_f:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f41c560bb6128e34968ee3abb4aa200fea46b9652381a589f42c6f6dc79b944",
      "text": "说的也是。那就听听大家的意见吧。\n所以说制作人，你觉得哪边更好？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bec1e4de3be193a2317e69e7ef658833a58aab846772d9c773fe7d55e8c9badd",
      "text": "这个嘛……蛋糕和甜甜圈\n各有各的长处，实在无法拿来比较呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b0f6b4138d8ac789ee9124ca39ad3d98546274d5abc9b0fda68cf54a0fb82d1",
      "text": "不过，唯独有一点是绝不会错的。\n那就是两者都是美味的食物！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df26176463a8b48ff9f1689b71ccd530b50e376e95fd93a37da1a671d15fa1e7",
      "text": "Yes！制作人酱说得太对了♪\n我也觉得两个都很delicious哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2bd738e4aaf912553b370586c010ce622f888c6f11448b54f557e791a9a9c83",
      "text": "反正我都喜欢啦。快点让我尝尝\n你们两个各自引以为傲的甜甜圈和蛋糕嘛♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfdb00b2a17af86efe84f366157ef00683d9d72d9ea74e4cde6eb5eac7231b10",
      "text": "既然如此，茶水就由在下来沏吧。在下刚好知道\n无论配甜甜圈还是配蛋糕都十分适宜的好茶。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49961fc8d3081be056e777f99aa4634698c15bfac35f2726914f25728eeda38f",
      "text": "说的也是啊。甜甜圈也好蛋糕也好，\n很好吃这一点本来就没什么两样嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3307bf80c1a20d13d45ed0d230418262e83000d942f88e5013ab5b389ad1481f",
      "text": "是的。正如制作人所说，\n它们的美味都是无法拿来衡量的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:766d287bdb115d67812048232418ac8c5793b508de9605aad13373886cfd9761",
      "text": "感觉有点对不住你啊。\n擅自说了甜甜圈才是第一名这种话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:560506faee2bb92c731382b913c2c3290c99ce5a13dd3f00368ea74d9027f36c",
      "text": "哪里，我这边才该道歉呢。\n一开始非要说蛋糕是第一名的，是我才对。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3268b46c03ed142ec5127849490e5e8fa3f54f6ea18b774625277ad46ca2c626",
      "text": "哎，卷绪。多跟我讲讲关于蛋糕的事吧。\n比如有什么推荐之类的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ef1e431043497067b8a984673d2cf32b92f9294eaafb17527f06e52d5ed67b9",
      "text": "当然可以！春名君也请多跟我聊聊\n甜甜圈的事吧。比如今天买来的那家店的事！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13a6f0190e7f3d88c5a2796400ceccf8b7aee1aaaca2baa8ab6a35d4d0ae88a0",
      "text": "嘿嘿。那我们俩这就算是结成甜点同盟啦。\n今后请多关照啦，卷绪。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07398a35f0abff344b2f4c73fd342a867310792915759574dd858785900940df",
      "text": "好！我才要请你多关照呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000164:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000171:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e9216d88cc7d5c2b1379720eb6fe347c86a15a0ffe22c290a8a7dc6a521baa2",
      "text": "辛苦啦～！\n我和卷绪组成了\n甜点同盟！<emoji>image_talk_emoji_31</emoji><emoji>image_talk_emoji_30</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000173:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83584748758d0b033f55f4757d3ebb4673170f6f948d6535811ffa30138e2909",
      "text": "首先来联络这个群里的成员！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000175:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05b672afe616898c79ca8542a9c13051f035fb36ab9d89ce26a1ffb88d139cc8",
      "text": "你们当中要是有喜欢\n甜点的人，\n请务必加进来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000177:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc3cb2a4e0c1567047001203fd84aa5789785b067b87987f574ff479950f7357",
      "text": "我可以跟认识的\n熟人打声招呼吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000179:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bbad0593493809b095810d8639b9a6f4b8dcbca7709958e77cf7bdab81d6d47",
      "text": "当然可以！\n我也正打算跟庄一郎先生\n说一声呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000181:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e443854318f5e106b0162b49ac1ed9067814b2e38ae150bb2ce4ffc147154098",
      "text": "这样啊！\n那我正好也想到一个人，\n待会儿也去跟他说一声～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000183:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce4f1773fc873647f8a3ae53c0258e90d2676a4b05dca112d73f876f338f1ef0",
      "text": "甜点吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000185:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcc660689a414a42881c8654131dee9ee98c2eb1d8ec3de596004c68831b6abc",
      "text": "嗯！九郎先生如果有\n认识合适的人，\n也拜托你啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000187:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95",
      "text": "明白了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000189:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a735183b4b3936326c71a751e22725f3b29dfdd6c7f15912e8bf99135f11740",
      "text": "我也去帮各位问问看吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000189:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c41f46ae28f96300211c0ca6d5ae3c4bcc6792bfda256c4fbf26be1f31d45a9c",
      "text": "我也去帮各位问问看吧。\n我刚好认识喜欢甜点的人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000190:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1479532bacf3559705d5a316a23c8fc9d7746f72ac84b5b880968b60e26170c7",
      "text": "下次我帮大家问问各位吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000190:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab4a98a9e63762fe7f6294b6f7d3427ebf24924ae772dc9b0a69e87d77aa31e4",
      "text": "下次我帮大家问问各位吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000194:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d986e8d40c0592b1a10d80ca154e48b06543832e85cb09b63a5a8b42ac363247",
      "text": "谢谢啦，制作人！\n大家也去问问各自的组合成员\n或者熟人吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000196:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b772af035bcf32d3a4f6f92d20a1ff1870b80c4c8886e87cf97533349e971bc",
      "text": "顺便一提，下次训练时\n我打算带蛋糕来当慰劳品哦。\n敬请期待吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_g:cmd-000198:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72c700940a5ce162003567ff5edae8fe00bfe35e63838f11b6038b0baad25e44",
      "text": "当然，再下一次\n就轮到甜甜圈啦！大家\n都好好期待着吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23319ccb385cf98a36c5501046bcfd0d81dfd03baf288a5bea09287a14a3abd9",
      "text": "观看视频的各位，大家好！\n今天由我们为大家带来声乐课的现场花絮！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e770907f9547d24748a9de2ff6bee8ff1d9c673af561a7c361202edc06d3295f",
      "text": "虽然本来是自由参加的，\n但因为5个人全员到齐了，所以就决定拍下来啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17cfda1d3d184147ea6fbaaee4f3c6679ec6c9a5f99922e0de1f95acf52ced7f",
      "text": "各位，准备好了吗？\n那么，这就开始warming-up吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27caadd00e7c8a782ad19e1ee4647454bc13e6cfa7ed51dd2b52ec51d04947bc",
      "text": "负责当Cameraman的Mr. 卯月，\n等会儿再跟我一起练吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92c4012e485d78ce699f6a3ed8c751a1ac6128bee2b9a9157ee8dcfacc8dd3d6",
      "text": "九郎先生。\n要不要一起热身？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c4abc5a96fa13226cc6a38adca804daa992f02cfbb5b7a596a98697a218716b",
      "text": "在下刚好正有事想同御手洗先生\n请教，不胜荣幸。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8366c0bced87c445cc33e4177bbf7433bd66527196125957bc00514adc2cc235",
      "text": "什么事呀？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f7bb7b9d73a22e02996296c7f7a6bd99c0404837885adc922981867592baf4f",
      "text": "在下有一些关于偶像前辈方面的事，\n想要请教御手洗先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1fdf833dc08723cef9d98b3fde11337729b5fdc6a38d95ab68f3f7d9843b954",
      "text": "比如工作之类的话题……不知能否一边做体操\n一边与您聊聊呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9490e9dd6b34911c07bd0576968ccf23bc1fdbf2e87fd5e46cb0c3c9872fa107",
      "text": "当然没问题啦～！\n作为交换，今天也要拜托你泡好喝的茶给我哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ef13686ca4667b65a7594f9087637ea74a6609aec9d1836a6405665e64978ce",
      "text": "呵呵，那自当包在在下身上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000162:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当天夜晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000170:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0021f4872c3caea0299754176741c463624a658ea2248725ac298d2ebb7be395",
      "text": "辛苦啦，●●●●プロデューサー。\n今天的汇报轮到我当班！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000172:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01fca22b84632c18ac19e8728d792f0e6862e0820f3ebe16d31d370a1cf27038",
      "text": "跟平时一样，练习顺顺利利地结束啦。\n还有就是，视频拍得多到甚至有点过头了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000174:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea15d377779a0f7a550dbb13cf16774821f3b04f6ebe48be13e4f6d15a676f7a",
      "text": "声音训练怎么样了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000177:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2e45c046df4cb20f7e45661471e568d9413ea36ae09628f0a2cbd102d545603",
      "text": "嗯，大家都表现得很不错哦。\n声乐老师也把我们狠狠夸奖了一番呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000179:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb4093727c92f775066edb86b20a8c0791403363343e2c9452702fa2f582219b",
      "text": "顺便说一下，今天除了练声之外，\n还稍微练了点舞蹈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000181:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bf4f1397016a7541284fecbe0e94abec7c94c782a99668c63edccc88c652fa8",
      "text": "所以呢，拍到了相当有趣的镜头哦。\n刚才不是说拍得有点过头了嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000183:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ff0e9a0b04106d66a52a9a35d2fdb711b89ba64e4094f525567af39e06d44af",
      "text": "重点就在这呢。\n要是剪辑师能给留下来就好了呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000185:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85022c8e703e4ddd778312c87eff4d3fa1ab54d1b2e3297f7f6ac29838b5cdc7",
      "text": "我也想让制作人看看呀！\n下次见面讲给你听哦。真的超级好玩的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000187:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff19c9dca684feceef768c4fae5bda76d61a9b5fddd3238f8cda46d60a1bf747",
      "text": "唔——\n下次见面是正式录音的时候来着？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000189:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3713580a9e5be0d0bd4652561b4afc5cf288e4560c798e6214f79ccf0bdbd48a",
      "text": "大家可有干劲了呢。都说要让制作人\n见识一下我们特训的成果！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_h:cmd-000191:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9ede76ccc9b968c9cf85390cdf1ccbc048c1b7002b99d0f99b180915d6b5c6c",
      "text": "那么，你就好好期待着吧～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_i:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fc941b59e4ee9854e131378b3108d968f16e2c7253ccd675af53bfad0b8ec55",
      "text": "录音当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_i:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a92c925210304f11dbd632b1a5e167556a0a16484c20b902ad03b0ebd47e9b37",
      "text": "终于要正式录音了呢。\n嘛，凭我们的本事肯定能过关的啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_i:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b74c28e0ff2ba30b7441d16c0eca8cffcc56a6e3bb4575fdba374c3acf9e998e",
      "text": "当然啦！Mr. 御手洗。\n让看视频的大家见识一下我们Lesson的成果吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecbd62ae3d9976ba4742e7217f3fc77c27d82543b27a2711e5450a1ea9219344",
      "text": "不过，还是会有点紧张呢……毕竟和往常\n不同，是必须对着摄像机镜头边拍边唱啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_i:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58014f36af0069d6c971923150ae006f324a1b52d16697902e907160232a7340",
      "text": "可能会因为害怕犯错，\n反而变得莫名在意起来呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_i:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a2df30fe42c18a55a39ad05cf1475c60ef176bd38f99627b3cd06e4045cff69",
      "text": "No problem啦。失败乃成功之母嘛！\n所以尽管放开了去失败吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_i:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1570706a899e4db2331863b5e96a54410113005f12a0f6cea1638b2215ba9507",
      "text": "多谢各位，在下会竭尽全力\n做好自己力所能及的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_i:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f8a149b762f96ea67ba909239065e370c13d8acf76d7929571eb02c0fcd3ee3",
      "text": "……啊啊，说的也是！\n好，我也得打起十二分精神加油啦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_i:cmd-000170:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c62d7773bec2b2e44f521f83b7989d7f370719f5055ed3be87b56af2552a2917",
      "text": "各位，准备好了吗？\n那么我们这就开始拍摄了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_i:cmd-000206:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e",
      "text": "随后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_i:cmd-000209:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:341bbc6d6224a8c17799458c21d9b66c3177b2521c1f8df20f15908616a56347",
      "text": "各位，录音到此全部结束！\n大家辛苦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_j:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12df72b01a8f085d154edbcbf412825ce01ee5253120f8466a0196ea648de3f4",
      "text": "啊～总算结束了！\n哎呀，刚进录音棚的时候简直紧张死了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_j:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afe87a9585c4dd14cbd5cf5160ec8208fb7cac98011d0f37b90eb3957c769ed8",
      "text": "不过，总觉得唱得比平时练习时\n还要更好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_j:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e023e24ef9fa85c59413cfafcb7ee0309afaafeb0d0ea4c3fc974eccc34cc47",
      "text": "我也是这么觉得的。而且，看到在控制室里的\n大家也在跟着一起唱的时候，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_j:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63fe8460a2c175f46d46b2e29449fdd152cba6f68d0c15e5febc438823e89abb",
      "text": "总觉得就像是在和大家同台合唱一样，特别开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_j:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3898da183e9dd160a2ed362c028a6a5e1daa082f390a5ffd666b7d70d7767a5",
      "text": "在下深有同感。多亏了看到各位唱歌的模样，\n在下才能遵照指示充满精神地唱出来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_j:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd8e2436476ac5593e8445e3cfec224a66e395ccb91b383fc97ad5b1eab3206a",
      "text": "嗯嗯。大家都唱得非常开心，\n我觉得very nice哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_j:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c6e9ea6ec8a841787f2e2b5300528aa4664826f2ecccf75bc8697eae3cc1911",
      "text": "这一定能成为一段\n让粉丝们非常满意的影像吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_j:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6ff0f3e4921861a973056ac9dd05b530ceab1658a9bbe04e862c54f57c64a4e",
      "text": "就是说呀～！\n真想早点看到剪好的完整视频呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_j:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70e85170c326e0f9d0908bfa5cd1e8357ee2bb83fa70066f4919652f4ae223e6",
      "text": "是啊。粉丝们想必也是\n翘首以盼吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_k:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_k:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bcd7c63f6f69c6baee7bcb50c2263b82dc655c0aafe3611c7874bf934b686f3",
      "text": "（视频终于制作完成了。今天就是\n和大家一起确认完成视频的试映会了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_k:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6aff0fea3b6363912e26844ca44a122358ecb09fc1f17876babf0236e78bdde",
      "text": "辛苦啦，各位！今天我也带慰劳品来喽！\n当然还是甜甜圈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_k:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bd426d36c6e2225fd4e380048fe55ec9d5162c6faf13619083797c65b05b7e6",
      "text": "我也带了蛋糕来当慰劳品。\n大家一起吃着看视频吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_k:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bfd8e84700fb439db8aa15527150afa8e241aca7ba2412aa66d41e1b3e7a564",
      "text": "嘿嘿，今天我也带东西来了哦！\n看，我在便利店买了各种各样的小零食♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_k:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf60fca9dc995c89a9090d3ab546d16819d65bcebb6c30853cbb3244e3318ffb",
      "text": "Oh！Mr. 御手洗也带了吗？我也在便利店\n买了一大堆drink过来哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_k:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b863ecc55872826bcf6fbd4a41c3d5687e9cf409e041919c7e7bf883255846f3",
      "text": "真是好壮观的分量啊。居然有这么多零食\n和果汁……真的能全部吃完吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_k:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49028c60573c21a6759b677fc38a3cddccab12c5499d18544c294fbc7756ac12",
      "text": "这点分量就算我一个人吃也是绰绰有余的啦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_k:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bdf3d6d67836a083e5618e3074fc0d58e01a3dbeb6ee6919be924c849701f61",
      "text": "早知道会变成这么有趣的场面，\n把这一幕也录进视频里就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_k:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6bd909be2dd04e2580ade7aac5f359266f073c0a7610e4919e389da736f9e8c",
      "text": "我刚才也在想同样的事呢！\n拍摄已经finish了实在太可惜了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_k:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95fbad4928ff0e9e93e65aeca9e7681ef1c2561f59035d8f2acb0a2d74a2da96",
      "text": "说的也是，太可惜了。\n……那么差不多该开始播放视频了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_k:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2ae08fa6a7e2385d84af4de55dfd05d09b59b77448ed0e7880ac9b7f044e9a9",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー。\n在那之前，在下也有个不情之请，不知可否？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_k:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:023925ce7f06a6d3c147796fd7b0519d2ce2274e948e1da78298c952bb9d4657",
      "text": "实不相瞒……在下今天也带了茶点过来。\n是在下最喜欢的和果子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_k:cmd-000187:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60659ec189297b9979ac474ed25300bd9f645bebf5c9a9738f6eea50f966e795",
      "text": "噢噢——！看起来超好吃！\n话说到头来，九郎先生你也喜欢吃甜食的吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_k:cmd-000192:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de3fa1086097e975681fb61b6b889c6a49825bd713d862f6f26cc7683c92afb9",
      "text": "我也是第一次知道……！\n既然如此，择日不如撞日。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30008_01:1_3_30008_01_k:cmd-000199:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e9811b76ba6a44da32327db40d826ab9a854c338d9709d9aa04e710af7ff705",
      "text": "九郎先生也加入甜点同盟吧！\n只要是喜欢甜点，种类完全不限！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
